These 3D headphones come apart and reassemble. A WorkBuddy agent using Tencent's Hy4 built them in Blender after two follow-ups.

I gave the agent 17 tasks in early access. Here are 6 results made using Hy4's API.

@TencentHunyuan @TencentAI_News @WorkBuddy_AI https://t.co/EHeAzWV6Vk

Aina is putting a small screen on a ring to bring AI actions closer to you.

@AinaInterface says the ring uses context from your devices and routines to suggest what you might need next: a join button before a meeting, or an approval for an AI agent's work.

